  "worked_solution": "The recursive formula for a geometric sequence with common ratio $r$ takes the form\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+1}=r\\cdot {a}_{n}.\n$$\n\nIn this case, the first term is ${a}_{1}=30,$ and we can calculate the common ratio $r$ as\n\n$$\nr=\\frac{{a}_{2}}{{a}_{1}}=\\frac{50}{30}=\\frac{5}{3}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the recursive formula is\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+1}=\\frac{5}{3}{a}_{n},\\,{a}_{1}=30,\\,n\\ge 1.\n$$",
